// spec/codingTools/index.md, "Sandbox path policy blocks sensitive locations, pseudo-descriptors, and escapes outside configured roots"; spec/codingTools/fileSession.md, "Reading a file records its current revision and binds a resumable reference"; spec/codingTools/shellSession.md, "Background shell sessions enforce concurrency caps and monotone incremental output polling"; spec/codingTools/worktree.md, "Entering and exiting a worktree keeps the directory stack and dynamic sandbox roots in lockstep"
